                    "number": "21",
                    "sid": "MAT 1:21"
                },
                "A week later, when the time came for the baby to be\ncircumcised",
                {
                    "type": "note",
                    "marker": "f",
                    "content": [
                        " ",
                        {
                            "type": "char",
                            "marker": "fr",
                            "content": [
                                "1:1 "
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "char",
                            "marker": "fk",
                            "content": [
                                "Circumcised "
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "char",
                            "marker": "ft",
                            "content": [
                                "A sign of the Abrahamic covenant.\nRomanian: ",
                                {
                                    "type": "char",
                                    "marker": "wl",
                                    "content": [
                                        "tăiat împrejur"
                                    ],
                                    "lang": "ro"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "caller": "+"
                },
                ", he was named Jesus, the name which\nthe angel had given him before he had been conceived."
            ]
        }
    ]
}
